---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-[#171717] text-gray-400 py-16 border-t border-white/5">
    <div
        class="container mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12"
    >
        <div class="md:col-span-2">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">Durrant Guitars</h3>
            <p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Your guitar shouldn’t fight you, it should beg for your touch. A great instrument lures you in, does things you never dreamed of, and makes you think it was your idea. You’ll soon realize your old guitars were faking it.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h4
                class="text-white font-medium mb-6 uppercase tracking-wider text-xs"
            >
                Explore
            </h4>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
                <li>
                    <a
                        href="/catalog"
                        class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Models</a
                    >
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a
                        href="/available"
                        class="hover:text-white transition-colors"
                        >Available Inventory</a
                    >
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a
                        href="/gallery"
                        class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Gallery</a
                    >
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="/about" class="hover:text-white transition-colors"
                        >About Tom</a
                    >
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h4
                class="text-white font-medium mb-6 uppercase tracking-wider text-xs"
            >
                Connect
            </h4>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
                <li>
                    <a
                        href="/contact"
                        class="hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"
                    >
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="opacity-60"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
                        Contact
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a
                        href="https://instagram.com/durrantguitars"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        class="hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"
                    >
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="opacity-60"><rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5"/></svg>
                        Instagram
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a
                        href="https://www.tiktok.com/@durrantguitars"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        class="hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"
                    >
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="opacity-60"><path d="M9 12a4 4 0 1 0 4 4V4a5 5 0 0 0 5 5"/></svg>
                        TikTok
                    </a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a
                        href="mailto:Tom.e.durrant@gmail.com"
                        class="hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"
                    >
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="opacity-60"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
                        Tom.e.durrant@gmail.com
                    </a>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div
        class="container mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs tracking-wide"
    >
        <p>&copy; {year} Durrant Custom Guitars. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</footer>
